        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Apr 16, 2024",
            "id": "d2ab09a1-1a5d-4661-8e6f-114161c93cdc",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hi there, thanks for staying with us at this property and for providing us with this review. We truly appreciate this feedback as we do our best to maintain these properties and to provide our guests with an exceptional experience. We are delighted that the property was perfect for you and that you especially loved the rooftop! We would love to welcome you again soon for another great vacation experience.\n\nRegards\nBenchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We had a wonderful stay at the rooftop house. It was beautiful, with so much room and all the amentities you would want. There was plenty of rooms for our group, plenty of bathrooms, and the rooftop was the bomb!! I liked the location becuase it was quiet and out of the crazy 30A. Thank you for offering this great rental.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Spring Break",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Arita J.",
        "date": "2024-07-05T19:44:58Z",
        "id": "66884d3e8c10871e4fe59db8",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Jul 20, 2024",
            "id": "11ed11f8-70db-4ed0-a710-5e5fb52e3b19",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thanks for staying with us at this property. We are delighted that you found the home beautiful. Regarding golf carts, please note that this is beyond Benchmark’s control as each community has its rules regarding golf carts. There are also some communities where only the owners of the property are allowed to use golf carts. Your suggestion regarding the bikes have been passed along to the proper parties. We would love to have you again for an even better vacation experience we know we can provide!\nThanks again for choosing to stay with us.\n\nWarm Regards,\nBenchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Beautiful house. Plenty of room. Great location. Super clean which is a huge bonus for a germaphobe like me. Would only suggest to allow golf carts. Most of the houses in the subdivision had golf carts, this would have made the beach trip more seamless. Adding bikes would be a nice addition. And we didn’t see a garage door opener. Other than that, our family loved it. Would definitely stay again.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Beautiful home/Great stay",
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
